OL,3,GNEWSAMotherwell feels like a 'failed
OL,4,Aproject', say residents frustrated by
OL,5,Aclosures
OL,6,
OL,7,FA council decision to demolish
OL,8,FMotherwell's well-used concert hall and
OL,9,Freplace it with a staff car park has
OL,10,Fleft the town feeling like a "failed
OL,11,Fproject from the 70s", residents have
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,FThe venue has been part of the town's
OL,15,Fcultural landscape for 50 years, but
OL,16,Fhas been out of use since 2023 when the
OL,17,Fpotentially dangerous concrete RAAC was
OL,18,Ffound.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
