OL,3,GNEWSAMotherwell feels like a 'failed
OL,4,Aproject', say residents frustrated by
OL,5,Aclosures
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe decision to knock it down last
OL,8,Fmonth follows the loss of swimming
OL,9,Ffacilities and an ice rink in recent
OL,10,Fyears, while the local town hall is
OL,11,Fbeing turned into flats.
OL,13,FNorth Lanarkshire Council said it
OL,14,Fcontinued to invest significantly
OL,15,Facross culture, leisure, housing and
OL,16,Fregeneration and its current projects
OL,17,Fwere "a strong commitment to the town's
OL,18,Ffuture".
